<section class="section section--page why">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <h2>Why we ring</h2>
    </header>
    {#- Her two paragraphs run as one (Rogan, 2026-09-29); the words are unchanged. #}
    <p class="section-p">Church bells are the Christian call to prayer. For centuries they have called the faithful to Sunday worship, rung the Angelus at morning, noon, and evening, pealed for weddings, and tolled in remembrance. When a bell falls silent, a congregation loses more than a sound. We exist so that call is heard again.</p>
  </div>
</section>

